    "title": "Launch preview: SpaceX seeks second attempt at Falcon Heavy launch following weather scrub on Monday - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Will Robinson-Smith ,\n2 days ago SpaceX will try again Wednesday to launch its Falcon Heavy rocket from NASA’s Kennedy Space Center, following a last-minute scrub Monday due to poor weather. The heavy lift rocket will use about 5.1 million pounds of thrust to propel ViaSat-3 F3 to a geosynchronous transfer orbit, the third and final satellite in the ViaSat-3 series. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
